{title: Tumhe Jo Maine Dekha}
{artist: Main Hoon Na Abhijeet Anu Malik}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Bm] [A],        Tum bhee ho, mai bhee hu,
[G] [A],        paas aao, toh keh du
[F#],        Aakhir kyun pal me yun
[G] [A] [Bm],        diwana mai ho gaya
[A],        Tumhe jo maine dekha,
[Bm],        tumhe jo maine jana
[F#] [B],        Jo hosh tha, woh toh gaya
[B] [A],        Badan kee yeh khushbu, jatane lagee jadu
[G] [F#],        Toh hoke bekabu, dil kho gaya
[A] [Bm],        Tumhe jo maine socha, tumhe jo maine mana
[A] [Bm],        Tumhe jo maine dekha, tumhe jo maine jana
[F#] [Bm],        Jo hosh tha, woh toh gaya
[Bm] [G],        Itni kyun tum khubsurat ho,
[A],        ke sab ko hairat ho Duneeya me
[E]
sachmuch hi rehati hai Pariyo se bhi jyada
[G] [A] [Bm] [F#],        pyaree see ladki koi
[Bm] [G],        Han itanee kyun, bolo hasin tum ho,
[A],        jo dekhe gum sum ho Dekho na
[E],        mai bhee hu khoya sa Behka sa mujhpe bhee
[G] [A] [Bm],        chhayi hai diwangee
[A] [Bm]
Tumhee ko maine puja, tumhee ko chaha pana
[A] [Bm],        Tumhe jo maine dekha, tumhe jo maine jana
[F#] [Bm],        Jo hosh tha, woh toh gaya
